# DRIFTLINE: a road hog is a car on the road. Shot (side guns only), it
# becomes a burning wreck worth nothing yet; only shooting the wreck pays
# its 500. A wreck left alone rolls back off the screen for nothing. Both
# kill a car they touch.
game driftline
wait 12
press A
cheat nospawn
wait 10
cheat pos 60
cheat meter 0
# one coming the other way
cheat foe 2 300 157 -1
hold B
waituntil foes_3 == 1 300
release
expect foes_2 == 0
expect score == 0
expect kills == 0
hold B
waituntil foes_3 == 0 300
release
expect score == 500
expect kills == 1
# a wreck left alone rolls back off the road (the car can't be hurt here)
wait 30
cheat god
cheat foe 3 300 157 -1
expect escaped == 0
waituntil foes_3 == 0 600
expect score == 500
expect escaped == 1
cheat god
# a wreck or a hog that reaches the car takes it
cheat foe 2 300 157 -1
waituntil alive0 == 0 400
expect cause == 102
waituntil alive0 == 1 100
expect spare == 2
